This repository contains the source code of the SC-3000 (ASC16L mapper) port
of Uridium.

The original MSX1 code and other assistance were provided by Arturo Ragozzini
(Artrag), who kindly gave his permission to create and publish this release.

Uridium is a game by Hewson Consultants. This repository is a fan port and is
not affiliated with or endorsed by the original authors or publishers.
No graphics, levels, music, sound effects, game data or ROM images are
distributed here.
